>
> - **操作类**：拉伸/stretch, 重绘/redraw, 压缩/compress, 擦除/erase, 补全/completion, 修复/repair, 间隙填充/gap_fill, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 填充/fill, 拼接/stitch, 缩放/scale, 镜像·反射/reflect, 印章覆盖/stamp, 裁剪/crop, 路径追踪/path_follow, 条纹传播/stripe_propagation, 重涂色/recolor, 旋转/rotate, 计数/counting, 分类/classify, 排序/sort, 堆叠/stack, 重复/repeat
> - **对象类**：直角线条图/rectilinear_drawing, 控制像素/control_pixel, 粗粒度块/coarse_block, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 边框竖条/frame_bar, 端点标记/endpoint_marker, 字形模板/glyph_template, 线段网络/line_network, 模板掩码/template_mask, 纯色色板/solid_swatch, 分栏面板/panel_column, 象限/quadrant, 锚点方块/anchor_block, 图案母题/motif, 分隔线/divider, 前景对象/foreground_object, 正方形块/square_block, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 棋盘格/checkerboard, 环形物体/ring_object, 引导像素/guide_pixel, 边界线段/border_segment, 精灵体/sprite, 空心矩形/hollow_rectangle, 实心方块/solid_square, 连通分量/connected_component, 单点标记/singleton_marker, 实心内部/solid_interior, 弯折形状/bent_shape, 拐角/corner_bend, 对角线段/diagonal_segment, 平行四边形区域/parallelogram_region, 空心精灵体/hollow_sprite, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 调色板图例/palette_legend, 矩形障碍/rect_obstacle, 射线路径/ray_path, 不完整副本/partial_copy, 缺失掩码/missing_mask, 模板精灵体/template_sprite
> - **空间关系类**：边缘对齐控制点/edges_align_control, 阵列排布/array_layout, 颜色对应形状/color_to_shape, 端点朝向/endpoint_facing, 行列对应/row_column_mapping, 尺寸比编码缩放/size_ratio_encodes_scale, 对角互补/diagonal_complement, 对角放射/diagonal_radiation, 路径连接/path_connected, 颜色循环/color_cycle, 旋转对称/rotational_symmetry, 模板与副本匹配/template_copy_match, 列归属/column_membership, 按类型分列/type_determines_column, 标记在分量内/marker_inside_component, 弯折数分类/bend_count_class, 平行配对/parallel_pairing, 边框色映射填充色/border_to_fill_mapping, 碰撞反弹/collision_bounce, 标记计数驱动重复/marker_count_drives_repetition, 标记归属最近线/marker_assigned_to_nearest_line
> - **条件/判断类**：控制点定拉伸界/control_stretch_bound, 含标记涂标记色/marker_presence_color, 锚点定位/anchor_position, 色板决定填色/swatch_determines_fill, 象限决定反射轴/quadrant_determines_reflection, 对角空位补块/complement_at_diagonal_vacancies, 延伸至边界/extend_to_edge, 终点相邻/endpoint_adjacent, 条纹范围差异/stripe_scope_difference, 提取原始瓦片/extract_source_tile, 非标记精确匹配/non_marker_match, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 列序映射颜色/column_rank_to_color, 内部判定类型/interior_determines_type, 邻域全包含/full_neighborhood_inside_component, 弯折数决定颜色/bend_count_color, 段间区域填充/fill_between_segments, 编码映射/encoding_map, 射线遇障碍翻转/ray_flips_on_obstacle, 标记数等于副本数/marker_count_equals_copy_count
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

